r","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids came in under 90% of normal in November to December in 40 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle ran 172% of normal in June to July and 30% in November to December. So far in 2026 the middle sits at 28% in February to March and 130% in June to July. Grid 25922 had its driest year in 2012 at 47% of normal.</p>"}
